BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventchristmasinfrederick3aholidaypopupbar26249-20261105@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261102T201135Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
SUMMARY:Christmas In Frederick: Holiday Pop-Up Bar
DESCRIPTION:Join RAK Brewing Co. & True Standard Distilling for an exclusive preview night featuring TWO completely transformed Christmas bars! Before Christmas in Frederick officially opens\, join RAK Brewing Co. & True Standard Distilling for an exclusive preview night featuring TWO completely transformed Christmas bars\, twinkle lights\, holiday cocktails\, music\, food and plenty of festive cheer! Thursday\, November 5\, 2026🎟️ $45 per person | 21+ ONLY 150 TICKETS! Once they’re gone\, they’re GONE. Don’t miss this opportunity! START HERE — CHECK-IN LOCATION FOR BOTH TIME SLOTS RAK Brewing Co. | 400 Sagner Ave. Check in\, grab your wristband and drink tickets\, and get ready to kick off the holiday fun! THEN\, HEAD TO…📍 True Standard Distilling | 10 N Carroll St. Keep the holiday hopping going with more festive drinks\, holiday magic\, and fun! Choose your adventure: 3:30–7:00 PM / 7:30–11:00 PM Your ticket includes admission to BOTH Christmas bars\, one complimentary drink at each location\, and the freedom to hop back and forth between both bars as much as you’d like during your selected time slot! Want to make it even more festive? Add a Double-Decker Christmas Bus ride for $25 per person! The Maryland Double-Decker will begin running at 4:00 PM from RAK Brewing Co. and will continue throughout the evening\, with the final bus departing True Standard Distilling at 11:00 PM. RAK’s full food menu will be available for purchase. Food will not be available at True Standard during Preview Night. Come dressed festive\, bring your valid ID\, and get ready to kick off the Christmas season in Frederick! One week before the event\, we’ll send you an email with all the special details you’ll need to know to make the most of your holiday bar hop! Christmas in Frederick officially opens to the public November 6. Please check each business’s website for current pop-up hours and opening times\, as hours may vary.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/christmas-in-frederick%3a-holiday-pop-up-bar/26249/
END:VEVENT
